# Prettier formats no markdown file. Three reasons keep this line.
#
# 1. Prettier pads the cells of every table. It therefore rewrites the
#    tables of the design spec and the tables of the test plan.
# 2. Prettier rewrites the YAML frontmatter of the note fixtures. Those
#    files hold a corpus of frontmatter shapes, and a test reads the
#    corpus byte for byte.
# 3. Prettier keeps every prose line as the line stands. Prettier
#    therefore reports no defect in a line that an edit left short.
#
# `npm run markdown:check` is the formatting gate of the markdown files.
# Do not cite `prettier --check` as verification of a markdown file. That
# command matches no markdown file, and it always reports success.
*.md

.github/
